Abstract = {This study aimed to examine how adolescents and young students face
   stressful events. Moreover, whether teenagers have positive or
   pessimistic attitude towards life. In this research the total number of
   the participants was 600 (279 senior high school students and 321
   University/Technological Educational Institute students at the
   municipality of Patras, Greece). The sample's age was 15-25 years old.
   According to the statistical analysis a tendency towards positive
   attitude of the population was noticed; 47,2\% of the subjects had
   negative attitude towards life's stressors and 52,8\% of the subjects
   had positive attitude towards stressful life events.},
