   HKSTS; IUE; JSCE; RICS; Urban Planning Soc China; China Civil Engn Soc},
Abstract = {This paper aims to develop strategies to manage risks associated with
   green retail building development. The research methodologies were
   comprised of a focus group workshop and content analysis. In response to
   the green retail building specific risks which were presented in a
   companion paper Risk Identification And Assessment In Green Retail
   Building Development, the following risk management strategies were
   derived from the research: Green Star accredited design managers
   conducting a full assessment of the project's potential to achieve a
   rating prior to contract award, inclusion of contractual requirements
   that purposely address the credit points targeted in the rating system
   in the head contract, stating the roles and responsibilities in
   head-contract specifications and briefs, managing the roles and
   responsibilities by using a documentation matrix, and providing training
   of the required rating system to all parties involved in the Green Star
   submission of projects.},
