Abstract = {In this study, the analytic hierarchy process was applied to construct
   the assessment indexes for intelligent elderly residential space, and
   the quantitative evaluation criteria was used to provide references for
   the construction and improvement of intelligent elderly residential
   space. Firstly, the present construction status and social needs of the
   intelligent elderly residential space were summarized by collecting and
   sorting out the relative literatures, and six assessment frameworks were
   developed. Then, expert questionnaire was prepared, the degree of mutual
   influence among the indexes was assessed and the weight corresponding to
   each framework was calculated.},
