   Management},
Abstract = {The formation of National Synthetically Reform Testing District can
   deepen reform and explore the regional economic development mode. The
   logistics industry plays a supporting role to regional economies. It can
   optimize the industrial structure and promote the formation and
   development of other industries in testing district. This study starts
   from the resources sharing logistics industrial cluster in National
   Synthetically Reform Testing District. It searches the interaction and
   relevance between National Synthetically Reform Testing District and
   resources sharing logistics industrial cluster using theories on the
   testing district and the logistics industrial clusters. Three major
   constraints of the process of the resources sharing logistics cluster in
   testing district are analyzed in detail. Then the regional coupled mode
   which can better promote the upgrade of the resources sharing logistics
   cluster is recommended. At last, the study discusses the upgrade of
   logistics., cluster in testing district in order to promote the economic
   development.},
