   Management},
Abstract = {To optimize the dairy logistics distribution network, a reasonable
   multi-level distribution network is designed because single tier network
   could not satify the distribution in large area. Firstly, logistics
   center (LC) is built near the factory and the distribution center (DC)
   is built near the customer, also this paper considers reliability as a
   measure of distribution sevice level besides cost. Then according to the
   specialty of the optimization model, the hybrid genetic algorithm is
   applied. Finally, a mumerical example is given, the result shows that
   the given algorithm is valid to the large-scale logistics network
