   Management},
Abstract = {The integration of agricultural products supply chain is based on
   information technology, having effective control and coordination to
   logistics, decision-making flow and capital flow. Through procession and
   systematic integration, the supply chain enables enterprises to share
   resources and information to optimize overall resources. We build a
   model in this paper, using electronic commerce technology to integrate
   agricultural products supply chain, we deem that management system for
   logistics information network of agricultural products be obliged to
   establish, extensively using the technology to speed up the integration
   of modern logistics and electronic commerce, founding the integration
   model of agricultural products supply chain based on electronic
   commerce. The conclusions is that to enhance the international
   competitiveness of China's agricultural products, the agriculture should
   make full use of electronic commerce technology and increase integration
