   Management},
Abstract = {This paper views from the city groups features in Guangxi Beibu Gulf
   Economic Zone, and pays more attention to the discussion on the inside
   of city groups which are the regional core economy inland ones. There
   are problems about how to realize industry coordination development
   between Beibu Gulf Economic Zone and the coastal cities that are
   economic hinterland, and industry coordination development among coastal
   cities. We consider that the cities in Beibu Gulf Economic Zone should
   depend on their resource advantages and development potential to make
   proper labor division, meanwhile, to strengthen industry coordination
   from the inside industry connection and outside government power among
   the cities, finally to realize common development of city groups
   industries.},
