Organization = {Sustainable Dev City Grp; Cent S Univ, Hunan Inst Syst Engn \&
   Management},
Abstract = {Industrialized house is a kind of advanced production methods which has
   the obvious advantages on the residential resources utilization
   efficiency. Construction of industrialized house is the way to cyclic
   Economy and sustainable development in China. During the current housing
   industrialization, how to promote industrialized house construction is
   an important thing which relate to the reformation of houses production
   mode. Based on the construction stage and using stage of
   industrialization, house resource utilization efficiency, including the
   resources utilization of land, materials, energy and water resources is
   respectively analyzed from the circular economy and sustainable
   development theory. This study adopts the theory of general system
   theory, comparative analysis in scientific methods and so on for the
   purpose of the whole analysis on the resource utilization efficiency for
   industrialized house. Especially in industrialized house energy
   utilization efficiency which we analysis in comparative scientific
   methods, the paper not only uses first-hand investigation in
   industrialization building demonstration zone of China VANKE enterprise,
   but also combined with the foreign industrialized house examples. We can
   come to the conclusion that the industrialized house has obvious
   advantage in resources utilization efficiency, and development gap in
   the housing industry can be found. We can foresee that the building and
   using of industrialized residences can greatly improve the efficiency of
   the housing resource utilization in accordance with the housing industry
   cyclic economy and the sustainable development concept, which has the
   vital significance in promoting the adjustment of housing industrial
   structure and the sustainable development of economy and society's
   progress.},
