   Management},
Abstract = {This paper presents the methodology of resource value flow accounting
   developed for a study which combined material flow analysis(MFA) for the
   coal-fired power generation plant, in order to shed light on concepts
   such as resource productivity and dematerialization of the coal-fired
   power plant. Different from the previous macro-level MFA, this paper
   analyzes the material cycle of coal-fired power plant based on the
   micro-scale, not only establish material balance model of the boiler
   combustion quantity center in accordance with the conservation principle
   of the mass and energy, but also analyzes the resource value flow and
   its components of the combustion quantity center. The findings show that
   resource value flow accounting information of coal-fired power plant
   will play an eco-guide role for the cycle of material and energy
   resources.},
