   economic development. In this paper, variational inequality was
   introduced to build up a closed-loop supply chain network equilibrium
   model, which is consist of double-closed-loop supply chain network
   equilibrium model, including manufacturers and consumer markets. In this
   model, members in the same layer of manufacturers layer and consumer
   market layer is the perfect Cournot pricing game. The products provided
   by the manufacturers are homogeneous, and manufacturers not only
   responsible for the production, but also need to recycle the products
   produced by their own according to the law. When all the players have
   made consensus of the product flows and prices between the two layers,
   the closed-loop supply chain network would achieve Cournot - Nash
   equilibrium. The model in this paper give full consideration to the
   Government's environmental laws and regulations which have outlined the
   specific instruction requirements of the enterprise, such as laws and
   regulations provided for each manufacturer EOL product recovery, as well
   as the lowest product recovery per unit of recoverable products,
   materials, utilization of and so on. The effect on the forward and
   reverse transaction volume and selling prices of products in the
   manufacturer - the consumer market resulted from the government laws and
   regulations, and moreover, the impact on total revenue of every
   manufacturer and consumer could be calculated, in the light of these, we
   could provide advice for enterprises to cope with the laws and
   regulations.},
