   Management},
Abstract = {An evaluation index system of logistics distribution center considering
   many factors is constructed, and the measurement standards of each index
   are given. In view of the shortcomings of the previous evaluation
   methods, the AHP is used to determine the subjective weights, and the
   rough set method is used to determine the objective weights, then the
   subjective and the objective weights will be organically integrated into
   a series of combined weights. Because evaluation of logistics
   distribution center based on the information is inaccurate, incomplete,
   namely, gray system. Thus based on combination weight a gray
   comprehensive evaluation model of distribution center is established. At
   the end of the paper, the feasibility and the practicality of this model
   are validated through a specific example.},
