Organization = {Sustainable Dev City Grp; Cent S Univ, Hunan Inst Syst Engn \&
   Management},
Abstract = {As a kind of high-intensity and high ductility steel, HRB500 bar has
   caused widespread concern by the experts. In this paper, based on the
   difference of tensile and compression modulus of elasticity as well as
   the area of tensile concrete, the proposed stiffness formula is inferred
   with the elastic-plastic mechanics theory. At the end of the paper,
   finite element analysis of beam is conducted, the deflection value
   calculated by the proposed stiffness formula and the current Codes are
   compared with the deflection value calculated by actual measurement and
   finite element analysis. The results show that: the deflection value
   calculated by proposed stiffness formula is very close to the deflection
   value calculated by actual measurement and finite element analysis,
   proposed stiffness formula can be used as reference when revise Codes.},
