   carried on. Based on the `structure of water resources carrying capacity
   research system, as well as water resources in the research region,
   socio-economic, ecological and environmental development of specific
   conditions, sustainable water resources carrying capacity model based on
   GPESH is built. Which is applied to the research of water resources
   sustainable utilization in Yunnan province, the status of water
   resources carrying capacity in 2000, 2010, 2020, 2030 is analyzed and
   forecast in research region, the outcomes make show that water resources
   carrying capacity in research region can load before 2030,but that is
   being transferred into not carrying. According to other literature
   research, the results of the study is reasonable, correct and in line
