   Management},
Abstract = {This article first introduced the feature of emergency events, and then
   analyzed of the timeliness and accuracy demand characteristics of the
   deployment of emergency supplies. In order to effectively deal with
   events, we must build reserves of supplies and emergency supplies for
   the deployment of network information processing center, so that it will
   be a trans-regional, inter-administrative region, shared resources, and
   be an emergency supplies fast network. The establishment of rapid
   response aiming at advanced information must be based on the existing
   network, be initiative, be a breakthrough to effectively evaluate and
   focus on rapid reaction to choose the shortest path, the most accurate
   information and materials with the volume to form a highly efficient
   system of action to maximize materials and equipments to enhance
   operational efficiency. We regarded the efficient and shortest time,
   safety and effectiveness as the crucial objective, and cost as the
   secondary condition. This paper puts forward the basic method of the
   proposed deployment of materials and delivery model. In a dynamic
   situation, when the emergency relief logistics system in some of the
   elements changed, the model how to respond as quickly as possible to
   establish a highly efficient system as soon as possible to meet the
   transport of goods to protect the establishment of emergency supplies
   fast network, is necessary and of practical significance.},
