   Management},
Abstract = {China's energy structure is dominated by coal consumption, the tunneling
   works accounted for a large share in the coal production process. Every
   year the new tunneling is above the tens of thousands of meters, More
   than 60\% of which are supporting surplus, at the time ensuring the
   safety and wasting a lot of supporting material, that is not consistent
   with the establishment of the concept of resource-saving society. To
   roof structure detectors and peep instrument's combination took as the
   principal means of observation, to calculation of the stability span of
   the beam took as a theoretical support, based on roof structural
   classification, in according with excavation roadway's different types
   goes on design of supporting parameters it is not only to ensure safety
   in production, but also save a lot of supporting materials, and to
