   Management},
Abstract = {Constructing green supply chain system is a necessary requirement to
   establish the ``two-oriented society{''} and implement sustainable
   development system. It has an important significance to the whole
   society to set up correct consumption views and social values. Based on
   analyzing the research status quo of related green supply chain and the
   existing problems at home and abroad, this paper combined the new
   mission that ``two-oriented society{''} endowed to social development,
   and put forward the following two new ideas to construct the green
   supply chain: the first is to strengthen the resource management of
   supply chain using TOC theory, definitude emphases on resource control,
   find the entry point to foster awareness of saving resources, and set up
   the coordinated control mechanism of supply chain that could make it in
   continuous optimization process; the second is to advance the process of
   environmental protection practice by using computer information
   technology. It could construct network platform, establish green
   database, advanced information system and computer simulation technology
   to strengthen the communication among enterprises, government and
   academia. The main purpose is to encourage the enterprise to go the way
   of environmental protection and implement the conception of green supply
   chain practically.},
