   Management},
Abstract = {The pilot project of the SO2 tradable permit system spread out in 2007,
   making it imperative to design a sound framework. As a market based
   environmental policy, the tradable permit system has the benefit of
   keeping emission at the cap in a cost effective way. However, in China,
   the greatest difficulty faced is the inactiveness of trading. Based on
   the experience of previous pilot projects, the author explores the
   potential reasons, and makes some suggestions about the design of the
