   Management},
Abstract = {The sustainable traffic safety is important for the development of
   resources-saving and environmentally-friendly society in changzhutan.
   Firstly, the traffic safety situation in changzhutan is analyzed.
   Accordingly, the causes of traffic accidents are probed, including poor
   construction and plan of traffic infrastructure, ubiquitous unsafe
   traffic modes, poor safety consciousness of the traffic participants,
   and lag of road traffic safety management. Finally, the effective
   strategies are advanced based on sustainable safety principles and the
   ``4E{''} system approaches for changzhutan, mainly including the
   improving traffic safety as a whole in the city groups, keeping safety
   ideas in the plan, design, construction and management of road traffic,
   developing sustainable traffic modes, encouraging safer traffic modes,
