   of fostering economic development. Since the late 1990s, many cities in
   China have cooperated to form the metropolitan area, which expands the
   field of regional cooperation among countries to the regional
   coordination among cities. As a central region connecting the east and
   the west of China, Wuhan metropolitan area's development is uneven,
   which has affected the sustainable development of economy and society,
   and enough emphasis should be put on it. In this paper, we make a study
   of the present economic situation of Wuhan metropolitan area by
   principal components analysis and factor analysis, and reach a
   conclusion of the development degree of units in Wuhan metropolitan
   area.},
