   Management},
Abstract = {Wedge stability against deep sliding is discussed for gravity dams.
   Based on the equal safety coefficient method and first-order
   second-moment method, the reliability indices of the two blocks are
   calculated. The system reliability index is calculated by means of
   equivalent linearization method. The results show that the two blocks
   with the equal safety factors has two different reliability indices.
   With the increase of the resistance's direction angle, the safety
   factors, reliability index and system reliability index change
   moderately. The sensitive coefficients of random variables are
   calculated, and the influence of statistic parameters of basic variables
   on reliability indices is analyzed, which can be used for reference in
   strengthening the weak intercalation of the gravity dams.},
