   Management},
Abstract = {The essence of the Two-oriented Society construction is to carry out
   `scientific outlook on. development', and the goal is to explore a more
   scientific, balanced, sustainable way of social development which
   differs from the traditional extensive economic growth mode. Economic
   growth is the central task of social development, while finance is
   hailed as the core of modern economy. Therefore, the Two-oriented
   Society construction is bound to fail without the support of finance.
   So, how does insurance one of the three backbones of finance play the
   role? This thesis first probes into the connotation, denotation and
   correlation of the Two-oriented Society, and then combines with the
   three functions of insurance to analyze the roles which insurance plays
   in the Two-oriented Society; finally it probes into the opportunities
   and challenges of insurance in the construction of the Two-oriented
