   Management},
Abstract = {The price strategy of closed-loop supply chain with product recycling
   between the manufacturer and retailer is studied under the optimal the
   channel for recycling. A model is established to find out the optimal
   reverse channel; the two price models are analyzed based on the optimal
   reverse channel to obtain the optimal pricing decisions and the optimal
