   Management},
Abstract = {With Chinese accession to WTO, Chinese small \& medium enterprises
   (abbreviation: SMEs) have made great progress and made a significant
   contribution for achieving the harmonious development of Chinese economy
   and society in recent years. However, there are still a lot of
   deficiencies in the development process of SMEs, among these
   deficiencies the weak awareness and capacity of independent innovation
   are particularly evident. This problem has seriously constrained the
   further development of SMEs and constrained its participating in the
   fierce competition home and abroad. As we all know, the technological
   innovation ability is the cornerstone of core competitiveness of modern
   enterprises. If we want SMEs to get fast and sustainable development and
   to achieve the maximum benefit, we must put the improvement of
   enterprise's technological innovation ability in a prominent position.
   In this paper, we firstly summarized the domestic and foreign research
   status quo and necessity of evaluation index system of technological
   innovation ability of SMEs. Then, we constructed the evaluation index
   system of technological innovation ability of SMEs and introduced its
   evaluation methods. At the same time, we put up an example for an
   empirical analysis. At last, we analyzed the results of calculation and
   drew relevant conclusions.},
